@startuml
title Bank Entity Model

class Bank {
  **Primary Key**
  --
  + ID : ObjectID
  --
  **Bank Details**
  --
  + Name : string
  + Code : string
  + BIC : string
  + Logo : string
  --
  **Status**
  --
  + Enabled : bool
  + IsDeleted : bool
  --
  **Timestamps**
  --
  + CreatedAt : time.Time
  + LastModifiedAt : time.Time
}

note right of Bank::Code
  Unique identifier for the bank
end note

note bottom of Bank
  **Field Descriptions:**
  **Name**: Full name of the bank
  **BIC**: Bank Identifier Code
  **Logo**: URL or path to bank logo
  **Enabled**: Active status
end note
@enduml
